<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{{ title }}</title>
<style>
:root {
  --bg: #f7f6f2; --surface: #ffffff; --text: #1f2328; --muted: #5d646c; --line: #dcd9d0;
  --accent: #2f6f8f; --accent-soft: #d9e8ef; --warn: #b5560f; --warn-bg: #fbeedd;
  --bad: #b3261e; --good: #2a7a43;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root {
    --bg: #15171a; --surface: #1d2024; --text: #e6e6e3; --muted: #9aa1a8; --line: #33383e;
    --accent: #6cb4d6; --accent-soft: #23404f; --warn: #f0a35e; --warn-bg: #3a2c1c;
    --bad: #f07a72; --good: #6fcf8c;
  }
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body { margin: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text);
  font: 16px/1.5 system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; }
main { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px 16px 64px; }
h1 { font-size: 1.7rem; margin: 0 0 4px; }
h2 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 40px 0 8px; padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
h3 { font-size: 1rem; margin: 20px 0 6px; }
p, li { max-width: 70ch; }
.sub { color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 16px; }
.note { background: var(--accent-soft); border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px 14px; margin: 12px 0; }
.warn { background: var(--warn-bg); color: var(--warn); border-radius: 8px; padding: 8px 14px;
  margin: 8px 0; }
.stats { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; margin: 16px 0; }
.stat { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 8px 14px; min-width: 110px; }
.stat b { display: block; font-size: 1.3rem; }
.stat span { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; }
.scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; background: var(--surface);
  border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; }
th, td { text-align: right; padding: 6px 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  white-space: nowrap; }
th:first-child, td:first-child { text-align: left; }
th { color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; }
tr:last-child td { border-bottom: 0; }
.chart { width: 100%; min-width: 560px; height: auto; display: block; margin: 8px 0; }
.chart .label { fill: var(--text); font-size: 13px; }
.chart .axis { fill: var(--muted); font-size: 11px; }
.chart .grid { stroke: var(--line); stroke-width: 1; }
.chart .baseline { stroke: var(--warn); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
.chart .ci { stroke: var(--accent); stroke-width: 2; }
.chart .dot { fill: var(--accent); }
.chart .bar { fill: var(--accent); opacity: 0.85; }
.legend { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; }
.heat td { text-align: center; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) calc(var(--v) * 45%), transparent); }
.heat td:first-child { text-align: left; background: none; }
.bad { color: var(--bad); }
.good { color: var(--good); }
code { font-size: 0.85em; }
pre { overflow-x: auto; background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px 14px; }
details { margin: 8px 0; }
summary { cursor: pointer; color: var(--muted); }
@media (max-width: 520px) { h1 { font-size: 1.4rem; } .stat { min-width: 90px; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<h1>{{ title }}</h1>
<p class="sub">{{ total }} games · Forge {{ forge_versions }} · generated {{ generated_at }}</p>
<p class="note"><strong>How to read this:</strong> {{ disclaimer }} Winrates carry 95% confidence
intervals; an average deck wins {{ baseline_text }} of games in a pod of {{ seat_count }}.</p>

<div class="stats">
  <div class="stat"><b>{{ outcomes.win }}</b><span>won</span></div>
  <div class="stat"><b>{{ outcomes.timeout }}</b><span>timed out (not losses)</span></div>
  <div class="stat"><b class="{{ 'bad' if outcomes.crash else '' }}">{{ outcomes.crash }}</b>
    <span>crashed (not counted)</span></div>
  {% if speed %}
  <div class="stat"><b>{{ '%.1f' % speed.mean_minutes }} min</b><span>average game</span></div>
  {% endif %}
</div>

<h2>Decks</h2>
<div class="scroll"><table>
<tr><th>Deck</th><th>Games</th><th>Wins</th><th>Winrate</th><th>95% interval</th>
<th>Win length (turns / rounds)</th><th>Timeouts</th></tr>
{% for d in decks %}
<tr><td>{{ label(d.deck) }}</td><td>{{ d.decided }}</td><td>{{ d.wins }}</td>
<td>{{ d.winrate | pct }}</td><td>{{ d.interval | ci }}</td>
<td>{% if d.mean_win_turn is not none %}{{ '%.1f' % d.mean_win_turn }} / {{ '%.1f' % d.mean_win_rounds }}{% else %}-{% endif %}</td>
<td>{{ d.timeouts }} ({{ d.timeout_rate | pct }})</td></tr>
{% endfor %}
</table></div>
{{ deck_chart }}
<p class="legend">Dot = winrate, bar = 95% interval, dashed line = {{ baseline_text }}. Intervals that
overlap cannot be told apart with this many games. "Games" counts games that had a winner.</p>

{% for ab in ab_sections %}
<h2>A/B: {{ ab.a }} vs {{ ab.b }}</h2>
<p>Run{{ 's' if ab.run_names | length > 1 }}: {{ ab.run_names | join(', ') }}. Both variants faced
the same opponents in the same seats.</p>
<div class="stats">
  <div class="stat"><b>{{ ab.difference }}</b><span>{{ ab.b }} minus {{ ab.a }}</span></div>
  <div class="stat"><b>{{ ab.interval }}</b><span>95% interval</span></div>
  <div class="stat"><b>{{ ab.p_value }}</b><span>p-value</span></div>
  <div class="stat"><b>{{ ab.detectable }}</b><span>smallest detectable difference</span></div>
</div>
{{ ab.chart }}
{% for warning in ab.warnings %}<p class="warn">{{ warning }}</p>{% endfor %}
{% if not ab.warnings %}<p class="good">The sample is large enough to resolve a difference of about
5 points, and the two variants faced comparable fields.</p>{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

{% if rating_chart %}
<h2>Ratings</h2>
<p>A model fitted to who won each pod (Plackett–Luce) gives each deck a strength; the chart shows
the winrate each deck would have against three reference decks.</p>
{{ rating_chart }}
{% endif %}

<h2>Seats</h2>
<div class="scroll"><table>
<tr><th>Seat</th><th>Games</th><th>Winrate</th><th>95% interval</th></tr>
{% for s in seats %}
<tr><td>{{ s.seat }}</td><td>{{ s.decided }}</td><td>{{ s.winrate | pct }}</td><td>{{ s.interval | ci }}</td></tr>
{% endfor %}
</table></div>
{{ seat_chart }}
<p class="legend">Seat 1 plays first in turn order, but the player who starts is chosen at random.</p>

<h2>Game length and speed</h2>
{% if rounds_chart %}
<h3>Rounds in won games</h3>
{{ rounds_chart }}
<p class="legend">A round is one pass around the table; a turn is one player's turn. Mean {{ '%.1f' % mean_rounds }} rounds
({{ '%.1f' % mean_turns }} turns).</p>
{% endif %}
{% if minutes_chart %}
<h3>Minutes per game</h3>
{{ minutes_chart }}
{% endif %}
{% if speed %}
<p>Median {{ '%.1f' % speed.median_minutes }} min, longest {{ '%.1f' % speed.longest_minutes }} min.
{{ '%.1f' % speed.worker_hours }} worker-hours of play at {{ '%.1f' % speed.games_per_worker_hour }}
games per worker-hour (game time only, without Forge start-up).</p>
{% endif %}

<h2>Data quality</h2>
{% for failure in failures %}
<p class="warn">Run task {{ failure.task_index }} crashed and its games are not counted: {{ failure.error }}</p>
{% endfor %}
{% for deck, hashes in deck_versions.items() %}
<p class="warn">{{ deck }} appears with {{ hashes | length }} different card lists; its results mix versions.</p>
{% endfor %}
{% if not failures and not deck_versions %}<p class="good">No crashed tasks and no decks changed between runs.</p>{% endif %}

<h3>Seat balance</h3>
<p>How many games each deck played in each seat; similar numbers mean the seats were rotated evenly.</p>
<div class="scroll"><table class="heat">
<tr><th>Deck</th>{% for n in range(1, seat_count + 1) %}<th>Seat {{ n }}</th>{% endfor %}</tr>
{% for deck, counts in balance.items() %}
<tr><td>{{ label(deck) }}</td>{% for n in counts %}<td style="--v: {{ n / balance_max if balance_max else 0 }}">{{ n }}</td>{% endfor %}</tr>
{% endfor %}
</table></div>

{% if ai_weak_notes %}
<h3>Cards Forge says its AI plays badly</h3>
<ul>{% for note in ai_weak_notes %}<li>{{ note }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
<p class="legend">These cards are flagged in Forge's card scripts. The decks are probably stronger
in human hands than in these results.</p>
{% endif %}

<h2>Appendix</h2>
{% for run in runs %}
<details><summary>{{ run.info.name }} ({{ run.kind }}, {{ run.games }} games)</summary>
<p>Run id <code>{{ run.info.run_id }}</code>, Forge {{ run.info.forge_version }}, started
{{ run.info.created_at }}.</p>
<table><tr><th>Deck</th><th>Card list fingerprint</th></tr>
{% for deck, h in run.info.deck_hashes.items() %}<tr><td>{{ deck }}</td><td><code>{{ h }}</code></td></tr>{% endfor %}
</table>
<p>Job settings:</p><pre><code>{{ run.info.job_json }}</code></pre>
</details>
{% endfor %}
</main>
</body>
</html>
